   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Progress Toward Outcome: Construction of the project&apos;s 2 desalination plants, at Betio and McKenzie, is complete. Commissioning of the McKenzie plant is ongoing, and the plant is expected to commence delivering water to the residents of South Tarawa before the end of Q4 2024. Commissioning of the Betio plant is delayed due to high concentrations of hydrogen sulfide in the source groundwater (which was not detected when the groundwater quality was analyzed in 2018). Solutions for the hydrogen sulfide issue are currently being identified and assessed and it is likely the Betio plant will be fully commissioned before 30 June 2025.</narrative>
    </title>
